        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In the construction sector, equipment fleet management poses a major challenge for companies. In fact, construction site tools are high-value equipment, and their poor management can generate&nbsp;significant additional costs for companies.&nbsp;Equipment is often distributed in different locations and used by many people, which can lead to loss, theft and lack of maintenance.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">To strengthen the security of goods and people, there are geolocation and automated warehouse solutions that allow for real-time visibility into the condition of equipment.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">This type of solution makes it easier to find site tools, thereby reducing wasted time for operators. This type of connected solutions also makes it possible to&nbsp;measure and analyze&nbsp;equipment utilization rates&nbsp;to trigger maintenance or recalibration operations in time, thus avoiding breakdowns and accidents.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "In the construction sector, equipment fleet management poses a major challenge for companies. In fact, construction site tools are high-value equipment, and their poor management can generate significant additional costs for companies. Equipment is often distributed in different locations and used by many people, which can lead to loss, theft and lack of maintenance.To strengthen the security of goods and people, there are geolocation and automated warehouse solutions that allow for real-time visibility into the condition of equipment.This type of solution makes it easier to find site tools, thereby reducing wasted time for operators. This type of connected solutions also makes it possible to measure and analyze equipment utilization rates to trigger maintenance or recalibration operations in time, thus avoiding breakdowns and accidents.",
